  "description": "*“Die in the game, and die in real life.”* \n\nTae-Yang must use his godlike gaming abilities to traverse the stages of rogue like virtual reality game “Dantalian” to find his trapped sister. The only catch is, in Dantalian, your life is synced to your character. If you die in the game, you die in real life. \n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
